<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that Imation Corp and ARCO Chemical Co were unavailable for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said Buenos Aires Embotelladora, Edison Brothers Stores Inc and Corimon SACA were unavailable in after-hours trading.</p>
